Changes from upstream GridPlayer
--------------------------------
- Subtitle files (.srt, .ass, .ssa, .vtt) dropped on a cell are attached to
  the video playing in it.
- Shift+L toggles a cell between Loop This File and its previous end action.
- [ and ] are extra keys for Set Loop Start / Set Loop End (they no longer
  seek -5% / +5%).
- Per-cell profiles saved with the playlist under stable cell ids.
- Aspect filter per cell: skip or ask about files of the other orientation.
- Browser cookies for yt-dlp (--cookies-from-browser) on the Cookies page.
- Shortcuts entry on the right-click menu.
- Fixes and smaller additions; see the git log for the full list.

